{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maze Escape: The Rolling Ball\u00a0</strong>is a physics-based puzzle game where you don\u2019t move the ball; you move the maze. <br>Tilt the platform with precision using the Mouse and guide the ball to the exit.<br>Every level introduces a new theme, such as a wooden box, a forest, or a city. <br>Avoid obstacles, such as pillars, spikes, and barriers, that stand in your way. <br>Master the Maze balancing to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engine: Unreal Engine 5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: FreeSound org</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assets: Fab/Quixel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PS: This is my very first Steam mini-game project, created as part of my journey to learn the process of making and publishing a game. I am excited to share it with you, and I plan to expand the game with custom assets, additional levels, and improvements over time. Feedback on ideas, features, and gameplay is greatly appreciated.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2433090?t=1757884328","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433090/b2e169eb00af03c32946d29921612f9fd4ea23c5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757884328","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433090/aaf8ffe0ab0da41eb3e08e0ff21ab053bdcd193f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757884328","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433090/aaf8ffe0ab0da41eb3e08e0ff21ab053bdcd193f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757884328","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maze Escape: The Rolling Ball\u00a0</strong>is a physics-based puzzle game where you don\u2019t move the ball; you move the maze. <br>Tilt the platform with precision using the Mouse and guide the ball to the exit.<br>Every level introduces a new theme, such as a wooden box, a forest, or a city. <br>Avoid obstacles, such as pillars, spikes, and barriers, that stand in your way. <br>Master the Maze balancing to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engine: Unreal Engine 5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: FreeSound org</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assets: Fab/Quixel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PS: This is my very first Steam mini-game project, created as part of my journey to learn the process of making and publishing a game. I am excited to share it with you, and I plan to expand the game with custom assets, additional levels, and improvements over time. Feedback on ideas, features, and gameplay is greatly appreciated.</p>","developers":["Sai Y"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433090/ecabc7f217b9e9e1aa35a4def32df9010cb8fe1b/header.jpg?t=1757884328","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2433090/119015249/3db58dcd326cc2141b1456d8f7d73cb0f13e113f/1757462956/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757463385","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2433090/119015249/3db58dcd326cc2141b1456d8f7d73cb0f13e113f/1757462956/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757463385","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2433090/119015249/3db58dcd326cc2141b1456d8f7d73cb0f13e113f/1757462956/hls_264_m